    <h2>Level 91 walkthrough: every move in order<span class="accent">.</span></h2>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 1–3</span>
      <strong>Drag the necklace (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Drag the necklace from the girl's neck to the rice ball. Drag the salad dressing from the windowsill to the rice ball. Drag the seaweed from the fish tank to the rice ball.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 4–6</span>
      <strong>Drag the chef's apron (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Drag the chef's apron to the rice ball. Drag the note from the fridge door to the rice ball. Drag the salmon from the poster to the rice ball.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 7–9</span>
      <strong>Drag the octopus (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Drag the octopus on the fridge to the rice ball. Drag the freckles on the girl's face to the rice ball. Drag the canned meat floss on the windowsill to Fantuan.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 10–12</span>
      <strong>Drag the bell around the lucky cat's neck (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Drag the bell around the lucky cat's neck to the rice ball. Drag the tablecloth to the ice bucket. Drag the shrunk tablecloth to the rice ball.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 13–15</span>
      <strong>Drag the chef's hair (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Drag the chef's hair to the rice ball. Click the bag on the table. Drag the lipstick from the bag to the rice ball.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 16–18</span>
      <strong>Drag the pearls (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Drag the pearls from the milk tea to the rice ball. Swipe up on the window. Drag the cherry blossom outside the window to the rice ball.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 19–21</span>
      <strong>Drag the eel (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Drag the eel on the curtain to the rice ball. Swipe right on the fridge. Drag the tofu from the fridge to the rice ball.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Step 22</span>
      <strong>Drag the chef's nose</strong>
      <p>Drag the chef's nose to the rice ball.</p>
    </div>


